/* The input language reserves br for nondeterministic choice.  An
   automaton that writes the choice's own transition q0 br -> q0 q0, as a
   recursion-scheme model checker's input would, is refused all the same:
   br takes no transition from the automaton. */
%BEGING
Main -> br a a.
%ENDG
%BEGINA
q0 br -> q0 q0.
q0 a -> .
%ENDA
%BEGINT
Main : q0.
%ENDT
